 own planet for other players to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Create your own stories and quests and give your world its own adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Join guilds, team up with friends, and take on the galaxy together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy is threatened by Ventax, the rogue architect whose corruption spreads across Freeland. Explore the worlds, uncover their stories, forge alliances, and shape your own destiny.<br><br><strong>Your character. Your world. Your adventure. Your Freeland.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1705390/extras/0bd7f183606744dd888ffde9f9f4fbfa.poster.avif?t=1786741046\" width=638 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1705390/extras/0bd7f183606744dd888ffde9f9f4fbfa.webm?t=1786741046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1705390/extras/0bd7f183606744dd888ffde9f9f4fbfa.mp4?t=1786741046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Enter Freeland, a multiplayer VR MMORPG! Explore vast planets, quest, level up, find epic gear, and battle bosses. Fly through space, race cars, ride dragons, horses and jet skis. Create your own full-body AI avatar, join guilds, or build your own planet, stories and quests!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1705390/446639927775b864c4ee40ff9072809fc51c5b79/header.jpg?t=1786741046", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1705390/2ceaf08da24a1d5941deb394ffea37c789a109ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786741046", "